        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <div style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; color: #cc0000;">8</div>
          <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
            <p style="font-size: 16px;">major research projects received grants exceeding <span data-field="grant_amount_1">{{ grant_amount_1 }}</span>, for a cumulative value of <span data-field="grant_amount_2">{{ grant_amount_2 }}</span>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
          <div style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; color: #cc0000;">150M</div>
          <div style="margin-left: 20px;">
            <p style="font-size: 16px;">in 2018, grant awards reached <span data-field="grant_amount_3">{{ grant_amount_3 }}</span>, an increase of <span data-field="increase_percent_1">{{ increase_percent_1 }}</span> from 2013.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px;">HIGH MARKS</h3>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">There were <span data-field="proposal_count_1">{{ proposal_count_1 }}</span> research proposals exceeding <span data-field="proposal_threshold_1">{{ proposal_threshold_1 }}</span> in 2017, the highest number in 5 years.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">Clemson researchers submitted <span data-field="proposal_count_2">{{ proposal_count_2 }}</span> of new proposals in 2017, another high point.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">In the 2018 fiscal year, research expenditures reached <span data-field="expenditure_amount_1">{{ expenditure_amount_1 }}</span>.</p>
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">Clemson University graduated <span data-field="graduate_count">{{ graduate_count }}</span> doctoral students in 2018, 47 more than 5 years ago.</p>
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">$150 million of research grants were awarded in 2018, the highest mark in the past 6 fiscal years.</p>
        </div>
