        <p style="font-size: 16px;">The Office of Animal Resources (OAR) strives to promote excellence in all animal research and teaching programs at Clemson University while promoting the highest standards in animal care and welfare. OAR provides high quality veterinary care programs, professional and technical support, education and training, and technologically advanced facilities and equipment for animal research and teaching activities.</p>
